        },
        {
          "text": "Na Leovoamu amwenda Maaka mwĩĩtu wa Avisalomu kũvĩtũka iveti syake na aka make ngombo onthe (nũndũ nĩwatwaie iveti ĩkũmi na nyanya na aka ngombo mĩongo thanthatũ, na asyaa ana mĩongo ĩlĩ na nyanya na eĩtu mĩongo thanthatũ). ",
          "type": "text",
